Hi Alex, and the Dojo teams,

Thank you, Alex, and sorry the first link was blocked. Here is the same stagi=
ng site on vesopa.com, an established domain:

  https://pontardawerfcmenu.vesopa.com/

Everything stays on this address: the menu, the terms, refund and privacy pag=
es, and the order page Dojo's checkout returns to. Card payments are on Dojo'=
s sandbox (the PontardaweRFC Demo key) and marked Test mode; a test order nev=
er reaches the club's till, kitchen or takings.

HOW TO TEST
1. Open pontardawerfcmenu.vesopa.com and choose a table (any table will do).
2. Add something to the basket and open it. Choose Pay now by card (test) and=
 press Pay =C2=A3x by card.
3. Pay on Dojo's checkout with your sandbox test cards (including the 3-D Sec=
ure and decline cards), or press its cancel option.
4. You come back to the order page on the same address: Test payment complete=
, or Payment not finished with the options to try again.

WEBSITE CHECKLIST
- Contact details: The foot of the menu shows the address, telephone and emai=
l, and Contact us opens pontardawerfcmenu.vesopa.com/legal/contact.
- Legal entity name: Pontardawe Rugby Football Club Limited, company no. 1005=
6776, at the foot of the menu and in the terms.
- Refund policy: A clearly labelled Refund policy: pontardawerfcmenu.vesopa.c=
om/legal/terms#refunds.
- Privacy policy: pontardawerfcmenu.vesopa.com/legal/privacy, which names Doj=
o (Paymentsense Limited) for online card payments.
- Terms and conditions: pontardawerfcmenu.vesopa.com/legal/terms, naming the =
legal entity, with a Paying online by card section.
- Card scheme logos: Visa, Mastercard, Apple Pay and Google Pay at the foot o=
f the menu.
- Secure checkout page: HTTPS throughout; card details are entered only on Do=
jo's hosted checkout (pay.dojo.tech).

END-TO-END HANDLING, READY FOR YOUR TESTING
1. Successful payment: Dojo's checkout returns to the order page on pontardaw=
erfcmenu.vesopa.com, which reads the result from the payment intent, never fr=
om the redirect.
2. Unsuccessful payment: the order page shows Payment not finished, with Pay =
now, Pay at the bar and Cancel. Nothing goes to the kitchen.
3. Successful payment after an unsuccessful one: Pay now refreshes the client=
 session secret before returning to the checkout.
4. 3-D Secure, successful and unsuccessful: handled on Dojo's checkout page; =
the result comes back through the intent.
5. Cancel on Dojo's checkout: the intent carries a cancelUrl as well as a red=
irectUrl, both to the order page, which says nothing was charged.
6. Paid, then the browser closed before the redirect: the payment_intent.stat=
us_updated webhook settles the order within seconds, and a check every minute=
 asks Dojo about any order still waiting, so a paid order is never lost.
7. Webhooks: the dojo-signature is verified (a forged one is refused with 401=
), and the server always confirms the status with Dojo before acting on it.
8. Errors (4xx and 5xx): if the checkout cannot be opened the order is cancel=
led and the customer told to try again or pay at the bar; if Dojo errors on a=
 retry the customer returns to the order page; a payment Dojo no longer has c=
loses as not paid; an approved payment still being captured is never cancelle=
d.
9. Refunds: a paid order cancelled on the till or the kitchen screen is refun=
ded through the API, with an idempotency key.

MORE VENUES
We are adding venues every week, and each runs its online menu and checkout o=
n Vesopa. What is the best way to do this for many venues?
1. Can the Vesopa integration be reviewed once, as a partner product, so that=
 each new venue only needs Account activation in its Dojo portal rather than =
a review of its own?
2. If each venue does need its site checked, is a vesopa.com address per venu=
e (like this one) acceptable as the site you review, while the venue's own do=
main is what customers use?
3. Is there a partner process or an API for submitting venues for online chec=
kout, so the activation can be started from our side when a venue joins?

Pontardawe RFC will apply for Online Checkout through Account activation in t=
heir Dojo Developer Portal, as you advised. Please let us know any points to =
address and we will turn them round quickly.

Many thanks for your help.

Kind regards,
